    {
      "id": "2116995373264756914",
      "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2116995373264756914",
      "title": "GitLabに2件の脆弱性、CISA KEVに登録 CVE-2026-97229/CVE-2026-110264",
      "author": "The Shadowserver Foundation (@Shadowserver) ※投稿者未検証",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-01T20:46:43Z",
      "summary": "ShadowserverがGitLabインスタンスを監視し、CVE-2026-97229（CISA KEV登録済み）に1000超、CVE-2026-110264に11300超の脆弱インスタンスを確認。影響：未パッチのGitLabでリモート攻撃リスク。対処：GitLab 19.5.1以降のパッチ適用（https://docs.gitlab.com/releases/patches/patch-release-gitlab-19-5-1-released/）。",
      "tags": [
        "CVE-2026-97229",
        "CVE-2026-110264",
        "GitLab",
        "KEV",
        "CISA"
      ],
      "collected_at": "2026-11-02T18:19:58Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "2117318521335972026",
      "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2117318521335972026",
      "title": "GitLab RCE脆弱性 CVE-2026-97229 積極悪用中",
      "author": "Dark Web Informer (@DarkWebInformer) ※投稿者未検証",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-02T18:10:48Z",
      "summary": "GitLab CE/EE 19.2/19.3/19.4にCVSS 10.0のRCE脆弱性CVE-2026-97229。CI/CD設定の悪意ある正規表現で認証不要のコード実行可能。CISA KEV登録済み、1,000超のサーバーが露出。修正版19.2.8/19.3.5/19.4.2で対応。",
      "tags": [
        "CVE-2026-97229",
        "GitLab",
        "RCE",
        "actively exploited"
      ],
      "collected_at": "2026-11-02T18:20:30Z"
    },
